# pd200x-control
===
 Linux app for the Maono PD200X and PD200XS USB microphone, a MAONO Link alternative: gain, monitoring, noise cancellation, EQ profiles and 7-band EQ, compressor, limiter and RGB ring light, live level meter, test recording and a level finder for quiet dynamic mics. Desktop app (Tauri) and CLI, written in Rust..
